Description: Raspberry Pi 4 and 5 support
 The build lists, configuration and hooks for the BCM2711 and BCM2712
 platforms, whose drivers are in xnu-overlay/. 16K pages on the BCM2712.
 pthread, HFS+, FAT, AMFI and the crypto provider are built into the
 kernel. The kernel takes its corecrypto interface from piecrypto, and
 xnu's corecrypto is not built.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-09
